      "body": "An off by one error was introduced to peephole.c by the \"off by one error fix\" in https://bugs.python.org/issue28517.  Clang's memory sanitizer detects it (msan).\r\n\r\nfind_op is ultimately called with h == codelen so it accesses one byte out of bounds.\r\n\r\nI have a fix, PR coming.",
